#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:5
#: 769fb83c883d4c1488617316d1e948fc
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:7
#: 82a83bdc77df4b19832c127dbd6bcdd1
msgid ""
"The stack supports several teleoperation inputs. They are not "
"interchangeable: some supply **end-effector pose**, some follow in "
"**joint space**, some drive **fingers or grippers**, and some only send "
"**enable / pause / FSM** assists. For a first run, use "
"[VR](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) or a [game "
"controller](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"本系统支持多种遥操作输入，彼此不能互相替代：有的提供**末端位姿**，有的在**关节空间**跟随，有的驱动**手指或夹爪**，有的只发送**使能 "
"/ 暂停 / FSM** 辅助。第一次上手，用 "
"[VR](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) 或 "
"[游戏手柄](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 8fb79ab8bce44f8a8969beac960699f5
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

