#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md e5e3810941b44b2086118400740fa9c9
msgid ""
"Headset (Pico Enterprise / consumer, Meta Quest), controllers or optical "
"hand tracking"
msgstr "头显（Pico 企业版 / 消费版、Meta Quest），手柄或光学手部追踪"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 951120cedfb64feb99356164dca9fc07
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Controller path (`./run.sh vr`, `./run.sh vr-xrt`): end-effector pose, "
"triggers, FSM and pause buttons. Hand tracking (`./run.sh vr-xrt wrist`, "
"`./run.sh vr-hand`): optical-wrist 6DoF and bare-hand gestures — "
"{ref}`Hand tracking <vr-hand-tracking>`."
msgstr ""
"手柄路径（`./run.sh vr`、`./run.sh vr-xrt`）：末端位姿、扳机、FSM 和暂停按钮。手部追踪（`./run.sh "
"vr-xrt wrist`、`./run.sh vr-hand`）：光学腕六自由度和空手手势 — {ref}`手部追踪 <vr-hand-"
"tracking>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md b4ead5f818f04dfa96d6bf8533a56d61
msgid "Game controller"
msgstr "游戏手柄"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 7f11bd0de96f433d97ea9ec9a1c837d7
msgid "Joystick / gamepad (`arms_teleop`)"
msgstr "摇杆 / 游戏手柄（`arms_teleop`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md d5136c4685cd43c4ba6259996a6563bc
msgid ""
"Arm velocity via `control_input` → twist; chassis `/cmd_vel` in chassis "
"mode"
msgstr "通过 `control_input` → twist 控制手臂速度；底盘模式下发 `/cmd_vel`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 2f71d4bf1b404902ba4799437ee352f9
