msgid ""
"Arm end-effector pose. Named **Vive Tracker** in the package and in these"
" docs, not “Valve Tracker”."
msgstr "手臂末端位姿。软件包和本文档中的名称是 **Vive Tracker**，而不是 “Valve Tracker”。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md bcb5c59094274c55b077afc348e63487
msgid "Foot pedal"
msgstr "脚踏板"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md f946753a833e49788b2bffa6a9b0163e
msgid "USB pedal (`arms_teleop`, SayoDevice CM6K)"
msgstr "USB 脚踏板（`arms_teleop`，SayoDevice CM6K）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 745a2b65a41444a998f5c29a14e83487
msgid ""
"Assist only: events on relative `teleop/controller_state`. Current mode "
"is `teleop/mode_state`."
msgstr "仅作辅助：在相对话题 `teleop/controller_state` 上发事件。当前模式在 `teleop/mode_state`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:19
#: 6d73d1bcaa074cb09425890ce09de27e
msgid "VR Headset Recommendation"
msgstr "VR 头显建议"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:22
#: 327f7471744b4e5da516cf682ec45a88
msgid ""
"For VR teleoperation, **Pico** and **Meta Quest** are the primary tested "
"headsets. Both can use **WebXR** (`./run.sh vr`) and **XRoboToolkit** "
"(`./run.sh vr-xrt`). **Pico Enterprise** is the preferred Pico SKU: it "
"supports **USB shared networking (USB 网络共享)** and uses a **different "
"headset App** from Pico consumer."
msgstr ""
"VR 遥操作主要验证过 **Pico** 和 **Meta Quest**。二者均可使用 **WebXR**（`./run.sh vr`）和 "
"**XRoboToolkit**（`./run.sh vr-xrt`）。**Pico 企业版** 是首选 Pico SKU：支持 **USB "
"网络共享**，并且使用与 Pico 消费版**不同的头显 App** — 不要把一个 App 当成同时覆盖两个版本。"

