"<teleop-topics-and-data>`. Wuji glove topics are on "
"[wuji_glove_teleop](5-wuji_glove.md). Vive Tracker lists its "
"`/teleop/left_ee_pose` and `/teleop/right_ee_pose` on "
"[vive_tracker_teleop](6-vive_tracker.md)."
msgstr ""
"话题、类型、QoS、命名空间和字段见 {ref}`遥操相关话题与数据说明 <teleop-topics-and-data>`。舞肌手套话题在 "
